    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U06-L07-ACTIVITY-011",
      "SourceSection": "7.2: Clock Coordinates",
      "SourceExcerpt": "At a certain time, the end of the minute hand of a third clock centered at \\((0,0)\\) has coordinates approximately \\((7.5,7.5)\\). How long is the minute hand of the clock if each grid square is one inch by one inch? Explain or show your…",
