    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U06-L07-ACTIVITY-012",
      "SourceSection": "7.2: Clock Coordinates",
      "SourceExcerpt": "The center of a clock is \\((0,0)\\) on a coordinate grid. Its hour hand is half the length of its minute hand. The coordinates of the end of the hour hand are about \\((3,0.5)\\). What are the approximate coordinates of the end of the minute…",
