    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U06-L07-ACTIVITY-013",
      "SourceSection": "7.3: Around a Ferris Wheel",
      "SourceExcerpt": "The center of a Ferris wheel is 40 feet off the ground, and the radius of the Ferris wheel is 30 feet. Point \\(P\\) is shown at 0 radians.",
