    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U06-L07-ACTIVITY-018",
      "SourceSection": "7.3: Around a Ferris Wheel",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Calculate how high off the ground point \\(P\\) is as the Ferris wheel rotates counterclockwise starting from 0 radians.",
